  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The library, its API and the binary format are unchanged since 8.3.0. Released together with Promptuarium.Serializer 8.4.0, which writes version 2 of the serializer layout (SERIALIZER_FORMAT.md: PRMT:GEN2-LE, PRMT:CFG2-LE, with typed integers, floating point numbers, DECIMAL, BIGINT, UUID, dates and times). The tools follow it: pcfg checks, shows (int32:8080, timestamp:2026-11-22T19:30:15+01:00), sets, imports and exports (YAML tags, JSON) the values of version 2 and saves a file with the lowest version that holds it; PStudio knows the new type codes and signatures, and shows the values of version 2 in new forms (sbyte, Int128, UInt128, Half, BigInteger, UUID, date, time of day, date-time, timestamp) by default. A file of version 2 is not read by the tools of 8.3.0 and earlier. pedit, ppak and ppakz are unchanged.",
